; fas9_dynamic_base.scr - step 9.9 of phase 9 (plan 2026-10-27-fas-9-typer.md, F9.9): the evaluation graph and the bases
; of the dynamic block elements. Run it with
;   python -I tools/fas9_facit_run.py doc/facit/fas9_dynamic_base.scr --input doc/facit/acad_2018_dxf_dynamic_blocks.dxf --out <directory>
;
; AutoCAD 2025's core has no -BEDIT, BPARAMETER, BACTION or BAUTHORPALETTE ("Unknown command"), so a dynamic block cannot
; be authored headless: the start is the AutoCAD-saved drawing of Erik's Block Editor session (script 16_dynamic_blocks.scr:
; HDXF_DYNAMIC with base point, alignment, linear, rotation, flip and visibility parameters, their grips and the stretch,
; rotate, flip and move actions; one INSERT of the definition and one INSERT of its anonymous block *U4). The core opens
; the DXF as it is and saves it again; what it adds is the state of the drawing after commands it does have:
;
;   dynbase            the drawing AutoCAD itself saves from that file (every record the step types: ACAD_EVALUATION_GRAPH,
;                      BLOCKGRIPLOCATIONCOMPONENT, BLOCKLINEARPARAMETER, BLOCKLINEARGRIP, BLOCKVISIBILITYPARAMETER,
;                      BLOCKVISIBILITYGRIP, ACDB_BLOCKREPRESENTATION_DATA, ACDB_DYNAMICBLOCKPURGEPREVENTER_VERSION)
;   dynbase shared     a third INSERT of the original definition: the definition is shared by two INSERTs and the
;                      anonymous block's representation (BLKREFS of the definition and of *U4)
;   dynbase renamed    the definition renamed: the true name in the XDATA AcDbDynamicBlockTrueName and the graph's
;                      owner chain stay, the INSERTs follow the new name
;   dynbase purged     every INSERT erased and the unused blocks purged: AutoCAD removes the definition, the anonymous
;                      block, the graph, its elements and the representation (the cascade of B19)
;
; Not made here (ej testat, F9.9): a change of a parameter, action or visibility state (needs the Block Editor or a
; dynamic property edit: the core has no -PROPERTIES for dynamic properties), BLOCKSCALEACTION by AutoCAD 2025 (the
; ACadSharp samples of AutoCAD 2000 … 2018 have it and are the facit for it).
;EXPECT ACAD_EVALUATION_GRAPH BLOCKGRIPLOCATIONCOMPONENT BLOCKLINEARPARAMETER BLOCKLINEARGRIP BLOCKVISIBILITYPARAMETER BLOCKVISIBILITYGRIP ACDB_BLOCKREPRESENTATION_DATA ACDB_DYNAMICBLOCKPURGEPREVENTER_VERSION
;SAVE dynbase
_.-INSERT
HDXF_DYNAMIC
200,0
1
1
0
;SAVE dynbase shared
_.-RENAME
_Block
HDXF_DYNAMIC
HDXF_RENAMED
;SAVE dynbase renamed
_.ERASE
_ALL

_.-PURGE
_B
*
_N
;SAVE dynbase purged
